-- Without a fixity declaration, an unparenthesized operator chain keeps its
-- pre-fixity behaviour: an arity error. No default fixity is assumed
-- (deliberate divergence from GHC's infixl 9 default), which makes fixity
-- declarations a strict conservative extension.

GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
      q IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
p PLAIN q MEANS p + q

#EVAL 1 PLAIN 2 PLAIN 3
